# Defense in depth for the Vercel deploy: with the static export dropped,
# everything under public/ is served as-is. Keep capture working files, raw
# accessibility snapshots, and secrets out of the deployment regardless of git
# state. (The site only needs the PNGs + the generated JSON.)
public/captures/**/_staging
**/credentials.md
public/captures/**/*.snap.json
public/captures/**/*.bak
**/*.pem
.env*.local
